{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reptile Island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to fight for survival on an island swarming with reptiles?</strong><br>Here\u2019s a spoiler: you will die. But the real question is how long you can endure, which weapons you choose, what structures you build, and how well you stand against the endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reptile Island</strong> is a fast-paced <i>roguelike bullet hell</i> survival game. Each wave grows stronger, every decision matters, and your survival depends on building, fighting, and adapting. Choose your character, arm yourself, place buildings, harness the power of totems, and resist for as long as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Wave-based survival</strong> \u2013 Face ever-growing hordes of reptilian enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 <strong>Multiple characters &amp; weapons</strong> \u2013 Experiment with unique playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Base-building mechanics</strong> \u2013 Defend your main base and expand your defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Inevitable death</strong> \u2013 You can\u2019t escape your fate\u2026 but you can decide how long you last.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000340?t=1758095828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000340?t=1758095828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000340/c2ba561e2a4835ab3ac361a49deecdd7524899df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758095828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000340/c2ba561e2a4835ab3ac361a49deecdd7524899df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758095828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","